{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489332,"name":"","username":"Ceneka","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/ceneka/{size}/59015_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T05:14:18.483Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489332-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489332-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://cursor.com\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/1/51167f0d9e990c5c47c573477d9c72392cf03ebf.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"B2B2AE\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eCursor\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/8/581af892e88b9b7e17a19773730e5d9907c03cec_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1A14\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eAI Coding Agent for Building Ambitious Software | Cursor\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eBuilt to make you extraordinarily productive, agents turn ideas into code. Accelerate development by handing off tasks to Cursor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489332-describe-the-request-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489332-describe-the-request-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI already have Grok Bot installed and Im using it.. but I still get “get grok bot” message all over the place.. pls, remove them\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489332-operating-system-if-it-applies-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489332-operating-system-if-it-applies-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System (if it applies)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\nMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\nLinux\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T10:56:48.061Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":11,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":56.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171404,"topic_slug":"i-already-use-grok-bot-stop-the-spam","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AI Coding Agent for Building Ambitious Software | Cursor","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":51663,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/i-already-use-grok-bot-stop-the-spam/171404/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":502355,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-28T03:54:07.485Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the feedback, and sorry for being pushy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo be honest, there isn’t a single setting right now that fully disables these in-app messages. You can close some promo surfaces one by one (the X or dismiss on the banner itself), but there’s no global toggle yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fact that the promo still shows up even when Grok Bot is already installed and being used is a fair point, I’ll pass it to the team. We’re also collecting similar feedback about in-app promo here: Stop putting advertisements over the code editor \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/169481\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eStop putting advertisements over the code editor. Permanently\u003c/a\u003e. Feel free to take a look and add your vote.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf there are any updates on settings, I’ll follow up.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-28T03:54:07.485Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171404,"topic_slug":"i-already-use-grok-bot-stop-the-spam","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/stop-putting-advertisements-over-the-code-editor-permanently/169481","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Stop putting advertisements over the code editor. Permanently","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_delet